{
  "_comment": [
    "UltraRT reflection material overrides (docs/reflections.md). Deployed next to UltraRT.dll; a second file with the same",
    "name in BepInEx/config is loaded after this one, so its rules win. Rules apply in order; every matching rule applies.",
    "Match fields (globs, * and ?, case-insensitive, all given ones must match): material, texture (main texture), shader.",
    "Set fields: class (ULTRAKILL SurfaceType name, Other or Mirror: resets to that class's defaults first), roughness,",
    "metalness, f0, specWeight (0-1, relative to -ultrart-spec-weight), reflMode (none, specular, blend, additive),",
    "reflStrength (0-1, blend/additive). Material names are matched without ' (Instance)'.",
    "Run with -ultrart-matdump to get BepInEx/ultrart/material-classes-SCENE.tsv with every material's result."
  ],
  "rules": [
    { "material": "Concrete*", "class": "Generic", "note": "tagged Marble for footsteps" },
    { "material": "CaveRock*", "class": "Generic", "note": "tagged Marble for footsteps" },

    { "material": "Metal Light *", "class": "Generic", "note": "lamp fixtures tagged Glass" },
    { "material": "Ceiling_Light*", "class": "Generic" },
    { "material": "CrossingLight*", "class": "Generic" },
    { "material": "Theater Lamp", "class": "Generic" },
    { "material": "JumpPadOff", "class": "Generic" },
    { "material": "ShopScreen*", "class": "Generic" },
    { "material": "M_ShopTerminal", "reflMode": "specular", "roughness": 0.12, "metalness": 0, "f0": 0.04, "specWeight": 1, "note": "CRT glass: faint Fresnel sheen instead of the game's 60% additive cubemap (screen is painted into the same texture)" },
    { "material": "M_TestamentTerminal", "reflMode": "specular", "roughness": 0.12, "metalness": 0, "f0": 0.04, "specWeight": 1, "note": "same layout as the shop terminal" },
    { "material": "SkullScreen", "class": "Generic" },
    { "material": "StainedGlassLit", "class": "Generic" },

    { "material": "Large *", "class": "Generic", "note": "credits portraits tagged MetalThin" },
